Design a circuit that serves as a digital inverter. It takes a multi-bit input signal (width defined by the parameter `lpm_width`) and produces a corresponding output where each bit of the input is inverted. This module effectively implements a logical NOT operation on the input data, ensuring that the output signal reflects the negated values of the input in real-time.
