description:
Design a toggle flip-flop circuit that changes its output state on the rising edge of the clock signal, provided that the reset signal (rst) is not asserted. When rst is low, the output (out) flips between high and low with each clock pulse; when rst is high, the output remains unchanged.
module top_module(
    input rst,
    input clk,
    output out
);

code:
module top_module(
    input rst,
    input clk,
    output out
);reg out_r;
    assign out = out_r;
    always @(posedge clk) begin
        out_r <= ~out_r && (~rst);
    end
endmodule

