Design a 4-bit maximum comparator circuit that takes two 4-bit input vectors, A and B, and outputs a 4-bit vector, max_out. For each individual bit position, the circuit compares the corresponding bits of the two inputs and selects the greater bit value, thus ensuring that max_out reflects the maximum value of the corresponding bits from A and B.
